		<minimumOsVersion>14.0</minimumOsVersion>
		<releaseNotes>In this release we made the following updates:
 
• Added support for completing in-session WebAuthn challenges by using local passwordless credentials.
• Added external identity support.
• Made updates to support macOS 27.
• Updated the UX to replace &quot;Frontline&quot; with &quot;Flex Dedicated&quot; and &quot;Frontline Shared&quot; with &quot;Flex Shared&quot;.
• Improved the Quick Launcher shortcut recording experience.
• Improved camera resource handling when closing a session window.
• Fixed a crash caused by a race between smart card redirection and session teardown.
 
In addition, we've also made numerous behind-the-scenes updates to improve performance and stability, and to lay the groundwork for some upcoming features.

If you encounter any errors, you can contact us via Help &gt; Submit Feedback.</releaseNotes>
